          {
            "title": "Closing tag",
            "id": 58994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione a tag de fechamento que está faltando.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\\h1&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use tags de abertura e fechamento correspondentes para colocar <code>Welcome</code> em um título <code>h1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h2&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\\h1&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Headings",
            "id": 58993,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione os trechos corretos para criar os cabeçalhos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Video games\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Console games\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Mobile games\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h3&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h4&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code> e finalmente <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use tags correspondentes: faça <code>Video games</code> ser o maior título e os dois tipos de jogo, os segundos maiores.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Video games\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Console games\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Mobile games\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h3&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/h2&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h4&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code> e finalmente <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Create a big heading",
            "id": 59039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dê a este site o maior cabeçalho.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Hello, World!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h2&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/h2&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/p&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Transforme <code>Hello, World!</code> no maior cabeçalho e dê a <code>Welcome</code> o segundo maior cabeçalho.</p><p>Use tags de abertura e fechamento correspondentes em cada título.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Hello, World!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;h3&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/h3&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/p&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;h2&gt;</code>, <code>Welcome</code> e finalmente <code>&lt;/h2&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: opening tag",
            "id": 63940,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com esta página da web?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"3D Printers\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Easy to get started\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Fun to play with\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Unlimited creativity\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Não há uma tag de abertura <code>h1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">As tags de parágrafo não estão montadas corretamente</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Algumas tags de fechamento estão faltando</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Não há uma tag de abertura <code>h1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A página deve começar com um cabeçalho e depois mostrar três parágrafos. Qual problema impede que o cabeçalho seja montado corretamente?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"3D Printers\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Easy to get started\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Fun to play with\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Unlimited creativity\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A primeira tag de cabeçalho é uma tag de fechamento</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Os elementos de parágrafo usam tags de fechamento antes do texto</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">O texto do cabeçalho pertence a um elemento de parágrafo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A primeira tag de cabeçalho é uma tag de fechamento.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 5",
            "id": 59583,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com essas tags de ênfase?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Purple Haze\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Há um sinal de <code>/</code> na tag de abertura</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não há uma tag de fechamento</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não há conteúdo dentro deles</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Há um sinal de <code>/</code> na tag de abertura.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O texto deve ficar dentro de um elemento de ênfase. O que torna a primeira tag incorreta?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Purple Haze\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ela começa com <code>&lt;/</code>, então é uma tag de fechamento</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ela usa o nome de tag errado para ênfase</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ela coloca o texto fora das duas tags</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ela começa com <code>&lt;/</code>, então é uma tag de fechamento.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 8",
            "id": 59093,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique a tag de abertura que define o texto como importante.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Dr. Amp's Gold Shovels\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Order now - \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"only $29.99\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;</code> seguido de <code>strong</code> e finalmente <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Envolva <code>only $29.99</code> em tags correspondentes para marcar o texto como importante.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Dr. Amp's Gold Shovels\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Order now: \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"only $29.99\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;em&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/em&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Order now:\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> seguido de <code>only $29.99</code> e finalmente <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 59083,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que a tag de quebra de linha é uma tag vazia?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Porque não tem uma tag de fechamento</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Porque não tem efeito na estrutura de uma página web</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Porque não tem uma tag de abertura</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque não tem uma tag de fechamento.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você adiciona <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> entre duas linhas de texto. Por que não adiciona <code>&lt;/br&gt;</code> depois dela?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> é uma tag vazia e não tem tag de fechamento</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> é uma tag de cabeçalho</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Porque tags vazias não têm tag de abertura</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> é uma tag vazia e não tem tag de fechamento.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Text between the tags",
            "id": 67563,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Exiba <code>Accept</code> no botão codificando entre as tags de abertura e fechamento.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h4\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Terms and Conditions\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h4\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"By clicking accept, you agree to helping a friend this weekend.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Accept\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"No way!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Reject\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>Accept</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Faça o primeiro botão exibir <code>Accept</code> e mantenha o segundo como <code>No way!</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h4\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Terms and Conditions\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h4\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"By clicking accept, you agree to helping a friend this weekend.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Accept\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"No way!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"140\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Agree\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Reject\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Terms and Conditions\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>Accept</code> seguido de <code>No way!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Button tags",
            "id": 67567,
            "contentType": "interactive",
